# Coleman Home Logo — Locked

**Do not edit, replace, restyle, or remove the Coleman home header logo** unless the operator explicitly requests a logo change in the same message.

## Locked implementation

- **Asset:** `/enterprise/coleman/coleman_logo.png` (source: `app/enterprise/coleman/coleman_logo.png`)
- **Component:** `app/enterprise/coleman/components/home/ui/HomeHeader.tsx`
- **Markup:** centered `Image` inside `.coleman-home-logo-wrap` with class `.coleman-header-logo` (72px height, 220×72 intrinsic)

## Forbidden without explicit operator request

- Swapping the image for a text wordmark (`COLEMAN`, `C O L E M A N`, etc.)
- Changing logo dimensions, asset path, or alt/aria labeling pattern
- Typography overrides that target `.coleman-wordmark` on the home header
- Replacing or deleting `coleman_logo.png` copies under `public/enterprise/coleman/` or `app/enterprise/coleman/`

## Allowed nearby work

- Other home page sections (KeyOrb, In-Ears, intelligence card, nav)
- Header layout for menu/avatar controls — **without** touching the logo link or image
